LhiI7Qvour4BfnKFDfkIo2F3e9G_jCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsV_3IaYNcCn40YUbP8noFb7_S5S573E_ZDG7OZl7oIrQ&oe=699EED22"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.08.47.png", "id": "1426309168884035", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_1426309172217368_1019297969091737075_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r0YzptfvjsUQ7kNvwFCrguw&_nc_oc=AdnNuRYtvEavM0bk6H627wUlOBqM5wG7HbuhQhltKeODcLOi9Li0SRMubLeStXh7Dm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvtL_clM4XHpOkwd3z_CUQgeBechGeRd50fllB-06VTuQ&oe=699EDB11"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.09.12.png", "id": "1791231008391357", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620432_1791231011724690_7646563548256713933_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lsQMqx-LJUMQ7kNvwEWbhME&_nc_oc=AdmR_3l_KpYKupdEZPzTout5WhGzknlfHP77WM5XfLfKGRlZanU4bq7_WGcgdMksoAw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuqGv4-tqnlUYkrSYi3bUEIcgN3cHo13wSlRTKD-fh03Q&oe=699F05A1"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.09.41.png", "id": "25923127443961648", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618264_25923127447294981_5221699009642254234_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MLfKceR_JgIQ7kNvwGkdGR1&_nc_oc=AdnEhb851OHWaJelZQM1haW1k9kaKcTF2gt4xPGTy2OQOk5ClUzqRyERfDREOgAiwMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuGTAfGuChw4iibMSm7Qdzw40kcuEbjFF-W5vVB9gx-fg&oe=699EF1F0"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.10.18.png", "id": "1374499653759686", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_1374499657093019_1388091325729183700_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=udFy_g4ed6kQ7kNvwEwmsSB&_nc_oc=AdmwTMhCOS8S1F_Z0KFw4QlRh7v8dIpKbHB5sRP1iNPtdo_J-ofm3D9boeQUK5n1wXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuBIHtCspgom4CFByJz8g9-5E1B2ts-OLMsW8SzZhh4Aw&oe=699EE66F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "S-Calculator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A stylish, simple, and easy-to-use calculator with a hidden feature\n\nA stylish calculator app with a design based on black.\nWe have simply gathered the functions needed for daily calculations, pursuing true ease of use.\n\n[Main Features]\n\u30fbBasic Functions: Arithmetic operations (+, -, \u00d7, \u00f7), percentage calculations, and sign switching (+/-).\n\u30fbUsability: Equipped with haptic feedback (vibration) when buttons are pressed.\n\u30fbDesign: Uses an eye-friendly dark mode and a highly readable programming font.\n\u30fbPrecision: Supports input of up to 15 digits, designed to minimize calculation errors.\n\n[Hidden Feature]\nTired of calculating? How about a little break?\nIf you tap the \"=\" button 5 times rapidly while in the initial state (when \"0\" is displayed), a hidden game mode will launch.\nPlease enjoy a simple yet engrossing side-scrolling action game.\n(Game Controls: Jump with \"0\", Return to calculator with \"AC\")\n\nMaking daily calculations a little more fun.\nWe hope you download and make use of it.", "short_description": "A stylish calculator designed in black. It distills daily functions into simplicity, created with a focus on pure usability."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Lubyte", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://lubyte.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NO